<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40528" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιπλέκ-ω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>wreathe</i>
			<i>into</i> a chaplet, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				12.256.5
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Mel.
			</span></i>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νάρκισσον ὑακίνθῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nonn.
					<u>D.</u>
					10.338
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>.
			<i>bind</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐχένα δεσμῷ</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				18.189
			</span></i>; <i>bind upon</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταρσῷ
				γυιοπέδην</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				36.365
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Cont.</u>
				16
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>. metaph.,
				<i>interweave</i>, <i>combine</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐτὰ τῷ τῆς παραλείψεως σχήματι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Rh.Al.</u>
					1438b5
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ</span>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διὰ τῶν αὐτῶν ὀνομάτων ἐπιπλέξαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aristid.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					2p.544S.
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. ἑαυτοὺς</span>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταῖς προσόδοις</span>
			<i>concern</i> themselves <i>with,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PTeb.
				6.39
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς ἐπιβολὰς τὰς Ἀννίβου ταῖς . .
					πράξεσιν ἐπιπεπλέχθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					4.28.2
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Dem.Enc.</u>
				8
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς Ἕλλησιν ἐ</span>. <i>to
				have dealings with . . </i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				14.2.28
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξένοις ἐπιπλᾰκέντες ἔθεσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					8.7.5
				</span></i>
			; also, <i>to have sexual intercourse</i>
			<i>with</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Posidon.
				36
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				J.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				36.2a
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιπεπλεγμένος</span>
			<i>mixed</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				<u>Sect.Intr.</u>
				6
			</span></i>; <i>complex</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυρετοί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					7.432
				</span></i>
			.</div>
